        <mxCell id="live" value="&lt;b&gt;Live, right now&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; executed &lt;b&gt;14&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#E8710A&quot;&gt;improved &lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; rolled_back &lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; manual_required &lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5F6368&quot;&gt;Most of those rollbacks are ours, generated while testing this system. We did not clear the ledger to improve the ratio.&lt;/font&gt;"
